teria,","size":10.98,"bold":false},{"bbox":[90.72,259.7,310.23,271.96],"text":"a range of variables, and an evidence guide.","size":10.98,"bold":false},{"bbox":[90.72,296.78,294.33,309.04],"text":"Q02 - Why we use learning materials?","size":10.98,"bold":true},{"bbox":[90.0,325.82,132.77,338.08],"text":"Answer:","size":10.98,"bold":false},{"bbox":[90.0,354.92,483.73,367.18],"text":"Learning materials are an aid to the learning process. They should not be for the","size":10.98,"bold":false},{"bbox":[90.0,369.44,475.77,381.7],"text":"benefit of the instructor or something that must be used all the time. They must","size":10.98,"bold":false},{"bbox":[90.0,384.02,310.05,396.28],"text":"facilitate the students’ learning. They should:","size":10.98,"bold":false},{"bbox":[108.0,398.41,115.41,410.67],"text":"•","size":10.02,"bold":false},{"bbox":[126.0,398.54,272.08,410.8],"text":"Arouse and maintain interest.","size":10.98,"bold":false},{"bbox":[108.0,412.99,115.41,425.25],"text":"•","size":10.02,"bold":false},{"bbox":[126.0,413.12,223.75,425.38],"text":"Simplify instruction.","size":10.98,"bold":false},{"bbox":[108.0,427.51,115.41,439.77],"text":"•","size":10.02,"bold":false},{"bbox":[126.0,427.64,193.86,439.9],"text":"Aid retention.","size":10.98,"bold":false},{"bbox":[108.0,442.09,115.41,454.35],"text":"•","size":10.02,"bold":false},{"bbox":[126.0,442.22,250.71,454.48],"text":"Stimulate active thinking.","size":10.98,"bold":false},{"bbox":[108.0,456.61,115.41,468.87],"text":"•","size":10.02,"bold":false},{"bbox":[126.0,456.74,369.34,469.0],"text":"Accelerate learning as more senses are involved.","size":10.98,"bold":false},{"bbox":[90.72,493.82,448.38,506.08],"text":"Q03 - Write down the nine steps that can assist you in your writing?","size":10.98,"bold":true},{"bbox":[90.0,522.86,132.77,535.12],"text":"Answer:","size":10.98,"bold":false},{"bbox":[90.0,551.96,313.14,564.22],"text":"Nine steps that can assist you in your writing:","size":10.98,"bold":false},{"bbox":[108.0,580.68,116.09,594.12],"text":"•","size":10.98,"bold":false},{"bbox":[126.0,581.78,393.76,594.04],"text":"Gain Attention – to orientate and motivate the learner","size":10.98,"bold":true},{"bbox":[108.0,595.98,116.09,609.42],"text":"•","size":10.98,"bold":false},{"bbox":[126.0,597.08,483.57,609.34],"text":"Inform Learners of Objectives – to guide learners and to assist them to","size":10.98,"bold":true},{"bbox":[126.0,611.6,417.6,623.86],"text":"organize their thoughts around what they are about to learn","size":10.98,"bold":false},{"bbox":[108.0,625.8,116.09,639.24],"text":"•","size":10.98,"bold":false},{"bbox":[126.0,626.9,507.46,639.16],"text":"Stimulate Recall of Prior Knowledge – because adults learn by establishing","size":10.98,"bold":true},{"bbox":[126.0,641.48,436.09,653.74],"text":"relationships with what they know and a new knowledge or skill","size":10.98,"bold":false},{"bbox":[108.0,655.62,116.09,669.06],"text":"•","size":10.98,"bold":false},{"bbox":[126.0,656.72,468.44,668.98],"text":"Present the material – in a way that appeals to the different learning","size":10.98,"bold":true},{"bbox":[126.0,671.3,284.26,683.56],"text":"references and is easy to digest","size":10.98,"bold":false},{"bbox":[108.0,685.44,116.09,698.88],"text":"•","size":10.98,"bold":false},{"bbox":[126.0,686.54,503.12,698.8],"text":"Provide guidance for learning – by providing opportunities to integrate new","size":10.98,"bold":true},{"bbox":[126.0,701.12,351.61,713.38],"text":"information into their existing knowledge base","size":10.98,"bold":false},{"bbox":[108.0,715.32,116.09,728.76],"text":"•","size":10.98,"bold":false},{"bbox":[126.0,716.42,423.1,728.68],"text":"Elicit performance by providing safe opportunities to practice","size":10.98,"bold":false},{"bbox":[108.0,730.56,116.09,744.0],"text":"•","size":10.98,"bold":false},{"bbox":[126.0,731.66,379.14,743.92],"text":"Provide feedback – to reinforce or correct learning","size":10.98,"bold":true}],"images":0,"annots":[{"xref":2